<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ Petroleum half-yr loss widens.</title>
<headline>NZ Petroleum half-yr loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half yr to November 30.</p>
<p>			   (million NZ$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net loss				    0.72 vs 0.51 loss</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)		     loss 7.5 vs 5.3 loss</p>
<p>    Pretax loss			   0.61 vs 0.42 loss</p>
<p>    Tax					nil vs nil</p>
<p>    Shares outstanding (million)   19.20 vs same</p>
<p>Note - New Zealand Petroleum Co Ltd is an oil exploration company.</p>
<p>--Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 4734746</p>
